	quest.3FC2D8DA0CBEEC9E.quest_desc: [
		"In order to bring this giant creature up from the abyss, you will need to craft a &bShade Maw Altar&r, then feed it&b Crystallized Blood&r and link a &bShadow Bell&r to it."
		""
		"Once you are done, just use the bell to summon the &eShade Maw&r!"
		""
		"This companion, unlike the others, is &btemporary&r. Its main purpose is for &atransport&r, since you can actually ride on top of it! It can also &abite&r and packs quite a punch."
	]
