		""
		"After teleportation, it will break and must be repaired using the &dRoyal Ender Pearl&r."
	]
	quest.42E0D95E05A9E239.quest_subtitle: "Attack like a Warden!"
	quest.43B53DF0E8DDD798.quest_desc: [
		"Inside the &bSwamp&r, you may have the chance to come across a much, much bigger &bWitch House&r than usual."
		""
		"Be careful, as this will (of course) be infested with not only &cwitches&r, but also some &cIllagers&r."
		""
		"Make it to the top and you will find a curious &eglove&r sweeping the floor!"
	]
	quest.43B53DF0E8DDD798.quest_subtitle: "Old hag has been doing improvements"
	quest.43B53DF0E8DDD798.title: "The Witch's House"
	quest.43F3A57742844BA8.quest_desc: [
		"Upgrading a common &bFurnace&r with &bCopper Ingots&r and &bBricks&r will give you the &eSoul Furnace&r as a result."
		""
		"Placing a &bGreat Chalice&r on top of it and filling it with &bEssence&r will allow you to cook certain materials into their &esoul-like counterpart&r!"
	]
	quest.43F3A57742844BA8.quest_subtitle: "Blazing spirit? Was this the way?"
	quest.43F3A57742844BA8.title: "The Soul Furnace"
	quest.445BE2D5B10DBEE0.quest_desc: [
		"&dThe Fishing Rod&r is a simple tool for catching fish, but it can also pull up valuable treasures from the water."
		"  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Fishing during &brain&r further improves bite rates."
	]
	quest.445BE2D5B10DBEE0.quest_subtitle: "Fish in any bodies of water"
	quest.44BDC7380BF8ED2A.quest_desc: ["Use this &eTotem&r to survive a fall &cinto the void&r."]
	quest.44D0A2AF3E0E0696.quest_desc: [
		"At night, an active &dCreaking Heart&r spawns a &eCreaking&r. It attacks players but cannot move while seen by any player."
		""
		"The linked &dCreaking Heart&r protects it from all damage, and breaking the heart kills the &eCreaking&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Hitting a protected &eCreaking&r causes &bResin Clumps&r to grow on nearby &bPale Oak Logs&r."
	]
	quest.44DA6E38B1776FAC.title: "Warden"
	quest.44DEBD1D9A5168DC.quest_desc: [
		"Use your new &bAlloy Smelter&r to create your very first &eAlloys&r."
		""
